      "statement": "A new command `reminders <date>` lists the appointments whose reminder is sent on that date under the reminder decision in force, in order of appointment time: `reminders on 2026-03-10: a1 at 2026-03-12 09:00, a2 at 2026-03-12 14:00`, or `reminders on 2026-03-10: none`. It changes nothing.",
      "status": "accepted",
      "owner": "Patient Services",
